{"id":788,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Although it’s called a guardian deity, terrible calamities sometimes befall those who recklessly approach Tapu Fini."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates water. Because it lives deep within a thick fog, it came to be both feared and revered."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"The guardian deity of Poni, it can control water. People say it can create pure water that will wash away any uncleanness."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"The dense fog it creates brings the downfall and destruction of its confused enemies. Ocean currents are the source of its energy."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Misty Surge","hidden":false,"description":"Turns the ground into Misty Terrain when the Pokémon enters a battle."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":788,"name":"Tapu Fini","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,55],[1,574],[5,110],[10,54],[10,114],[15,392],[20,352],[25,362],[30,432],[35,505],[40,57],[45,330],[50,212],[55,717],[60,585],[65,56],[70,487],[75,581]],"machine":[59,362,347,605,291,577,203,263,374,416,447,385,56,63,58,8,196,334,113,478,581,330,583,182,240,115,156,496,219,503,247,214,684,173,500,164,57,269,271,127,250,472],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"swsh6-40","name":"Tapu Fini","set":"Chilling Reign","date":"2021-06-18","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"40","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"swsh6/40"},{"id":"sma-SV92","name":"Tapu Fini-GX","set":"Hidden Fates Shiny Vault","date":"2019-08-23","rarity":"Rare Secret","number":"SV92","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sma/SV92"},{"id":"sm11-53","name":"Tapu Fini","set":"Unified Minds","date":"2019-08-02","rarity":"Rare","number":"53","artist":"Hasuno","img":"sm11/53"},{"id